@startuml sequence_consultation
' --------------------------------------------------------------
' Sequence Diagram - patient consultation workflow
' Figure 3.5 in the BTech report
' --------------------------------------------------------------
title Clinix - Patient Consultation Sequence

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Helvetica, sans-serif"
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F9
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #888888

actor Patient
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "AI Engine\n(Gemini)"   as AI
participant "Django REST API" as API
database  "PostgreSQL"          as DB
participant "Agora\n(Video)"    as Agora
participant "Provider App"      as Provider

Patient -> App  : Enter symptoms / image
App     -> API  : POST /ai/chat/<id>/message
API     -> AI   : Forward conversation + vitals
AI      --> API : Reply (next question)
API     --> App : Reply
App     --> Patient : AI recommendation

App     -> API  : POST /ai/chat/<id>/complete
API     -> AI   : Request structured assessment
AI      --> API : { triage, specialty, causes }
API     --> App : Structured assessment

Patient -> App  : Book appointment
App     -> API  : POST /appointments/
API     -> DB   : Insert (status='pending')
API     --> App : Appointment created

Patient -> App  : Pay (mobile money)
App     -> API  : POST /payments/initiate/
API     --> App : USSD code
... User dials USSD on phone ...
API     <-- API : CamPay webhook
API     -> DB   : Mark payment='success'\nAppointment='confirmed'
API     -> Provider : FCM notification

Provider -> API : Join consultation
API     -> Agora : Issue RTC token
Agora   --> Provider : Token
Patient -> Agora : Join channel
Provider -> Agora : Join channel
Agora   -- Patient   : Media stream
Agora   -- Provider  : Media stream

... Live consultation ...

Provider -> API  : POST /consultations/<id>/end\n+ notes, diagnosis
API     -> DB   : Save consultation
Provider -> API  : POST /consultations/<id>/audio
API     -> API   : Celery task:\nSTT + Gemini draft
API     -> DB    : MedicalRecord(is_ai_draft=true)

Provider -> API  : Review + publish draft
API     -> DB    : is_published=true
API     -> App   : Notify patient
App     --> Patient : Receive prescription &\nmedical record
@enduml
